  "firstUnmetRequirement": "Under five concurrent ordinary authenticated POSTs, the two-connection browser lifecycle pool refused two checkouts before BEGIN. The browser-auth owner advanced from storage_ready generation 1 to unavailable generation 2. A serial authenticated GET still returned 503 when both pool connections were idle and no checkouts were queued. Restarting the owned Phoenix application restored the existing session and same-key replay without new jobs. The observed behavior blocks local availability and recovery under bounded load.",
