  "scope": [
    "Two independent PostgreSQL 17.11 clusters. Phoenix/Oban uses SCRAM on IPv4 loopback, and the release cluster uses a private Unix socket only.",
    "Normal Phoenix HTTP routes with signed test issuer login. Separate release origin served 48 peer-verified TLS GETs using an ephemeral certificate authority.",
